It's debatable that SDSM + CoMR + "oLS is the best combo.  That combo
basically ties up the cloak slot where you can get other many nifty
cloaks like Displacement and Oilskin.  OTOH, GDSM will tie you up
either the neck slot, prohibiting the "oLS, or shield slot, prohibiting
spell casting and two-weaponing.

My feeling is that it doesn't matter *that* much if you wanna go for
SDSM or GDSM.  Since you already went for GDSM, I'd just go with it.
So wish for boots.  And if you know you want to go for GSm go ahead and
wish for one right now.  And wait to see if other stuff shows up while
you are doing through Sokoban and Mine town.  Then after you are done
with sokoban and mine town, you should blow the rest of the wishes on
"o Ref (After sokoban, I suppose), helmet, gauntlets, maybe convenience
items like bag of holding, and then magic marker.  Remember, you could
get SDSM from a dragon, which you might run into in the Ludios or
Castle, or you could simply reverse-geno if you know the genocide
scroll and have a cursed scroll you can blank.

Once you reach Castle, you get more wishes...so you can pretty much do
whatever you want ot reconfigure your armors.  You might have found a
cloak of MR at this point, or might have found another cloak you like
better.  But since you've already wished for GSDM, might as well, stick
to it until Castle, where you get opportunity to reconfigure.  

